F1	xselection | guess
alt+w	control windowmanager close_window
shift+alt+m	control windowmanager maximize_window
alt+v	xsimulate click 2
alt+c	xselection | xcopy
XF86AudioRaiseVolume	control audio change_output default volume_up
XF86AudioLowerVolume	control audio change_output default volume_down
XF86AudioMute	control audio change_output default volume_mute
XF86MonBrightnessUp	display up
XF86MonBrightnessDown	display down
